LAMBDA
========

Set up virtual environemnt on local

mkdir ghactivity-downloader
cd ghactivity-downloader
python3.8 -m venv ghad-venv
source ghad-venv/bin/activate
pip install boto3
pip install requests
mkdir ghalib
pip install requests -t ghalib


go to pycharm - open project - select ghactivity-downloader folder from local and open it in pycharm and make sure interpreter is pointing to ghactivity-downloader location

zip -r ghactivity-downloader lambda_function.py - to create the zip file from pycharm terminal
zip -g ghactivity-downloader lambda_function.py - to update the zip that was already created


to include the requests module in the zip , do the following in the pycharm terminal

cd ghalib
zip -r ../ghactivity-downloader.zip .
cd ..
zip -g 

